With `tags.yaml` at the tier root every record's `tags:` is checked against it, the first
failure per tag reported on the `tags:` line: a known tag passes; an unknown one, a tag that is
not kebab-case, a sub-tag missing from the dictionary although its area is present, and a listed
sub-tag whose area is absent each give one finding; a scalar `tags:` is not a list.

-- fixtures/cwd/.booping --
project_name: probe
vault_path: ./vault
latest_migration: 9999
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/tags.yaml --
ui: Interface
ui:hud: Heads-up display
net: Networking
combat:melee: Close combat
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/value/0001-hud.md --
---
type: value
title: Hud
summary: The Hud value.
kind: value
created_by: owner
created_at: 2026-01-01
updated_at: 2026-01-01
tags: [ui:hud]
---

Why the project exists.

## In practice

It shows in every run.
